# Data layer (api / transformers / types)

Base URL: `import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE_URL` in `@/api/client`.
Cable URL: `import.meta.env.VITE_CABLE_URL` in `@/api/cable/client`. Both come from `.env` (see `.env.sample`).

## API (`src/api/`)

- Only call `apiRequest` from `@/api/client` — never raw `fetch` from pages/components.
- Paths: `/api/v1/...`. Domain folders + `index.ts` re-exports.
- Verb functions: `listTags`, `createTag`, `getTag`, `updateTag`, `deleteTag`.
- List/create/update/show usually return transformed domain results; simple mutations may return the API response type.
- List query params: Ransack (`q[name_cont]`, `q[active_eq]`) and snake_case (`per_page`).

`apiRequest` already sends JSON + Bearer token, credentials/locale cookie, retries once on `401`, throws `ApiError` (`status`, `message`, `details`).

## Transformers (`src/transformers/`)

Convert API ↔ domain. Named helpers: `tagFromResource`, `tagCollectionFromApi`, `tagShowFromApi`.

- Normalize attributes with `keysToCamelCase` from `@/utils/case`.
- Pagination via `toPagination` in `@/types/api/pagination`.
- Never transform inside pages/components.
- Create/update: typed payloads (`TagCreatePayload`) built in the page/API layer; do not map raw responses in the UI.

## Types (`src/types/`)

| Kind | Example |
| --- | --- |
| Domain | `Tag`, `User` |
| API wire | `TagAttributesApi`, `TagCollectionResponseApi` |
| Form | `TagForm` |
| Request | `TagCreatePayload` |
| UI result | `TagListResult` |

No `I` prefix. Avoid `any`; prefer `unknown`, generics, explicit types. Domain camelCase; API shapes use `*Api` when they differ.
